L168: |**Exercises**<br>|**1.**<br>Standing<br>position.<br>Barbell<br>overhead<br>press. After<br>3 sets- 1-<br>minut<br>break. <br>**2.**<br> Standing<br>position.<br>Barbell<br>behind neck<br>press. After<br>3 sets- 1-<br>minut break. <br>**3.**<br> Standing<br>position.<br>Barbell curl<br>in a full<br>range of<br>motion.|**1.**<br>Kneeling<br>straight on<br>peanut type<br>gymnastic ball<br>(perpendicular<br>to the long side<br>of the peanut<br>ball) -<br>maintaining<br>balance. <br>**2.**<br>Lying<br>forward on a<br>peanut type<br>gymnastic ball<br>(lying along a<br>peanut ball<br>with a<br>possibility to<br>hold on the<br>ball) - keeping<br>the balance on<br>the ball so<br>that no part of<br>the body<br>touches the<br>ground. <br>**3.**<br>Straddle sit<br>on the<br>peanut ball<br>(the body<br>should not<br>touch the<br>ground).|**1.**<br> Barbell<br>squats to the<br>right angle<br>(barbell<br>behind the<br>neck) in a<br>moderate<br>pace. <br>**2.**<br>Barbell squats<br>to the right<br>angle (barbell<br>behind the<br>neck) in a<br>variable pace<br>(1 x slow, 1x<br>fast, 2x slow,<br>2x fast, 3x<br>slow, 3x fast,<br>4x slow, 4 x<br>fast,  5x slow,<br>5x fast). <br>**3.**<br> Isometric<br>contractions<br>with knees<br>bent to the<br>right angle<br>squat in a<br>variable<br>duration,<br>according to<br>the scheme:<br>10s, 15s, 20s,<br>25s, 30s, 25s,<br>20s, 15s, 10s.|
L169: |**Exercises**<br>|Between sets, participants performed a<br>10–15s isometric exercises with the<br>elbows bent halfway (at 90 degree).|Between sets, participants performed a<br>10–15s isometric exercises with the<br>elbows bent halfway (at 90 degree).|Between sets, participants performed a<br>10–15s isometric exercises with the<br>elbows bent halfway (at 90 degree).|
